'''William Tell''' (ウイリアムテル, ''Uiriamu Teru'', '''William Tell''') was a 2-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 4.0 Update|Version 4.0]].

==Effect==
Cat Cannon Recharge UP (Sm): Cat Cannon will charge 5 seconds faster.

